*   **Self-Employment Tax Deduction:** You get to deduct half of the self-employment tax you pay on your marketing net income as an adjustment to income.

### 3. How to Handle the Home Office
Since you are self-employed (marketing clients), you can claim the Home Office Deduction for the space used *exclusively and regularly* for your business. You have two ways to calculate this:

